      <title>许家印一审被判无期徒刑，恒大集团罚金超百亿</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260820/%E8%AE%B8%E5%AE%B6%E5%8D%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A1%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%A4%E6%97%A0%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%92%E5%88%91%E6%81%92%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E7%BD%9A%E9%87%91%E8%B6%85%E7%99%BE%E4%BA%BF/</link>
